      "blocks": {
        "overview":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u23-2026-pdp-01-overview.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U23 jump starter overview","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"U23 overview","heading":"Compact backup power for a no-start moment.","body":"<p>A carry-ready 12V kit for emergency starting, device power and visibility. <strong>8,000mAh / 29.6Wh</strong> stored energy, <strong>1,500A peak</strong> and <strong>700A starting current</strong> are shown in a calm, practical format.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "starting":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u23-2026-pdp-02-starting.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U23 connected for a vehicle start","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Starting support","heading":"Built for the compatible 12V vehicle.","body":"<p>The documented fit reference is up to <strong>6.0L gasoline</strong> or <strong>3.0L diesel</strong>. A full charge can provide <strong>up to 25 starts</strong> using a standard 1.5L sedan as the reference; real results vary with battery health, temperature and engine condition.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "capacity":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u23-2026-pdp-03-capacity.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U23 8000mAh capacity feature","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Capacity","heading":"Power that stays ready between trips.","body":"<p>The 8,000mAh / 29.6Wh battery is designed for repeated roadside readiness. Keep U23 charged and use it only on the compatible 12V vehicles listed in the manual.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "vehicle_fit":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u23-2026-pdp-04-vehicle-fit.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U23 compatible vehicle range","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Vehicle fit","heading":"Built around the 12V vehicle routine.","body":"<p>Use the U23 with compatible 12V cars within the stated engine range. Check the vehicle’s battery condition and follow the manual’s clamp sequence before attempting a start.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "device_power":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u23-2026-pdp-05-device-power.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U23 Type-C input and USB-A output","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Device power","heading":"A useful power bank between roadside calls.","body":"<p>Recharge through <strong>Type-C 5V / 2A</strong> in about <strong>3–4 hours</strong>; the USB-A port provides <strong>5V / 2.4A</strong> for everyday phone and small-device charging.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "led":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u23-2026-pdp-06-led.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U23 150LM LED emergency light","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Emergency light","heading":"See the connection, signal the situation.","body":"<p>The original product callout keeps its <strong>150LM</strong> value. The manual specifies a <strong>5W</strong> light with <strong>Steady, Flashing and SOS</strong> modes for roadside use.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "safety":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u23-2026-pdp-07-safety.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U23 six core safety safeguards","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Smart clamp safety","heading":"Protection made visible at the clamp.","body":"<p>U23’s smart-clamp system is described with <strong>10 total safety protections</strong>. This graphic preserves the visible <strong>6-in-1</strong> core safeguards: reverse polarity, short circuit, over-voltage, over-current, overheat and over-discharge. <strong>UL 2743</strong> is cited for the model.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "scenarios":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u23-2026-pdp-08-scenarios.jpg","image_alt":"SuntNeew U23 for everyday vehicle and outdoor scenarios","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Ready where you park","heading":"One small kit for routine and unexpected stops.","body":"<p>Keep the U23 accessible for commutes, weekend trips and the moments a vehicle needs a little backup. Store it dry, inspect the clamp before each use and recharge after use.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "steps":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u23-2026-pdp-09-steps.jpg","image_alt":"Four U23 jump-start steps","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"Four-step start","heading":"Connect deliberately. Start with confidence.","body":"<p>Charge U23 to at least 50%, connect the smart clamp, confirm its green indication, then start the vehicle within 30 seconds. Disconnect as directed once the vehicle has started.</p>","variant_match":""}},
        "in_box":{"type":"feature","settings":{"image_asset":"suntneew-u23-2026-pdp-10-in-box.png","image_alt":"SuntNeew U23 items included in the box","image_fit":"cover","eyebrow":"What’s in the box","heading":"The essentials are already together.","body":"<p>U23 main unit, Intelligent Jumper Clamps, Type-C charging cable, user manual, color box and carrying pouch.</p>","variant_match":""}}
