        "q1":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"Which vehicles is U23 designed to support?","answer":"<p>U23 is for compatible 12V vehicles, with a stated reference of up to 6.0L gasoline or 3.0L diesel engines. Confirm the vehicle, battery condition and manual before use.</p>"}},
