        "q4":{"type":"question","settings":{"question":"Can U23 charge a phone or small device?","answer":"<p>Yes. The USB-A output is specified at 5V / 2.4A for everyday device charging. Recharge the U23 itself through its Type-C 5V / 2A input.</p>"}},
